OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo will bring westerly
OL,6,Fsevere gales and frequent heavy
OL,7,Fshowers in the morning. Winds
OL,8,Fgradually easing in afternoon with
OL,9,Fsome bright spells developing between
OL,10,Fthe showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FQuite breezy with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers at first but becoming largely
OL,14,Fdry with light winds by midnight.
OL,15,FClouding over from the south overnight
OL,16,Fwith some rain in the south by morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
