OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloud and rain spread north
OL,6,Fthrough the morning and becoming
OL,7,Frather windy. Drier for a time in the
OL,8,Fafternoon before further heavy rain
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,12,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, some
OL,13,Fheavy. Bright spells and scattered
OL,14,Fshowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,15,Fdry later. Bright spells and variable
OL,16,Fcloud on Thursday, becoming quite
OL,17,Fwindy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
